================================================================================
License compatibility
================================================================================

The MIT-licensed `arduinojson` and `lua_cjson` are compatible with
both Apache-2.0 and AGPL-3.0-or-later. The Apache-2.0 components
(`zap_common`, `metrics`) are compatible with the AGPL-3.0-or-later
ones: a firmware build that links both is distributed as a combined
work under AGPL-3.0-or-later; each component retains its own license
when used in isolation.
